System Architecture
UPSTOX
→ MARKET DATA
→ NORMALIZATION
→ DATA QUALITY
→ REDIS / CLICKHOUSE / PARQUET
→ CANDLE ENGINE
→ FEATURE ENGINE
→ MARKET INTELLIGENCE
→ SCANNER
→ OPPORTUNITY ENGINE
→ TRADE TYPE
→ STRATEGY
→ PROBABILITY + EV
→ RISK
→ OMS
→ UPSTOX EXECUTION
→ RECONCILIATION
→ JOURNAL / PATTERN DNA / RESEARCH
Backend layers
API → Application Services → Domain → Repositories/Adapters.
Frontend
Next.js → feature modules → API/query state + realtime store → chart/table/UI components.
Realtime
Upstox → ingestion → event bus/Redis → realtime gateway → browser.
Principle
A feature must have one clear owner. Do not duplicate calculations across frontend and backend when the result affects trading decisions.
